THIS PETITION, COMING ON FOR ORDERS, THIS DAY,
ORDER WAS MADE THEREIN AS UNDER:
CORAM: HON'BLE MR. JUSTICE S.VISHWAJITH SHETTY  ORAL ORDER This writ petition under Article 226 and 227 of Constitution of India is filed seeking for the following reliefs:
"a) Issue a writ, order or direction in the nature of certiorari, quashing the impugned order dated 23/11/2017, passed by the respondent no.1 SLAO vide Annexure-E bearing No:PA/s/ii/LMP/4:1999- 2000 AP 23/11/2017;
(b) Issue a writ, order or direction in the nature of mandamus, directing the respondent No.1 SLAO not to award interest under Section 34 of the Land Acquisition Act, 1894;
(c) Pass such other order in the interest of justice and equity."
